<item><title>Zambian football club bars two fans from all its matches over political symbol</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/zambian-football-club-bars-two-fans-from-all-its-matches-09efef/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/zambian-football-club-bars-two-fans-from-all-its-matches-09efef/</guid><category>Zambia</category><description>The supporters were filmed displaying a symbol associated with Zambia&apos;s governing United Party for National Development during a match against Nkana FC.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:49:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zm.jpg" length="32768" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Livingstone High Court nullifies Mulobezi election over Grade 12 certificate</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/livingstone-high-court-nullifies-mulobezi-election-over-b8f8ca/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/livingstone-high-court-nullifies-mulobezi-election-over-b8f8ca/</guid><category>Zambia</category><description>The ruling found Hastings Sililo lacked the required certificate when nominated for the August 13 parliamentary poll.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:46:58 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/livingstone-high-court-nullifies-mulobezi-election-over-b8f8ca/share.jpg" length="42941" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/livingstone-high-court-nullifies-mulobezi-election-over-b8f8ca/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
